  "details": "I think it would be cool to have achievements for VRChat. So people can see what you did in the game, here are 10 achievements I thought of right here on the spot:\n\n1. Friendly - add at least 10-20 players.\n\n2. Reached [rank] - get your account level to [rank].\n\n3. Looking nice! - Upload a avatar to VR Chat\n\n4. Nice place - Upload a world to VR Chat\n\n5. Small Group - Own a group with 100 Members.\n\n6. Not Today! - Have a Vote-to-Kick succeed.\n\n7. Savor the Moment - Take a picture in VR Chat\n\n8. Now you Know - Create your First BIo in VR Chat\n\n9. Saving this for later - Favorite a World/Avatar\n\n10. KITTY! - Pet the cat in the VR Chat Launch Pad (hidden achievement)\n\nI could think of more but I think these 10 achievements put my thoughts into perspective.",
